WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,290 --> 00:00:07,650
That zombie is looking at us

2
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:15,040
Just an ordinary zombie?

3
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:28,880
The captain of the Ji boat is right there

4
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,120
Cui Zixuan read that right

5
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,340
That zombie is being controlled by Jizhou

6
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:38,000
Not that we are coming

7
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:40,190
The base forced a search order

8
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:41,990
I didn't say where the base is

9
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:44,310
I didn’t report what I saw last time in Xinghe either.
